sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Channel as Channel<br/>(Telegram/Discord/...)
    participant Gateway as Gateway (Axum)
    participant BtwRouter as BtwRouter
    participant Coordinator as AgentCoordinator
    participant AgentSrv as AgentServer
    participant RustBridge as RustBridge (HTTP)
    participant AgentLoop as Agent Loop (Rust)
    participant Provider as LLM Provider
    participant Tool as Tool Executor
    participant Memory as Memory Backend
    participant Hooks as Hooks (Hermes)
    participant BtwServer as BtwServer

    rect rgb(240, 253, 250)
    Note over User, BtwServer: Flow 1 - Inbound Message Processing
    User->>Channel: Send message
    Channel->>Gateway: ChannelMessage (via listen)
    Gateway->>BtwRouter: route_message/3
    BtwRouter->>AgentSrv: run_task/3
    AgentSrv->>RustBridge: run_task/3
    RustBridge->>AgentLoop: HTTP POST /api/agent/run
    AgentLoop->>Provider: LLM inference request
    Provider-->>AgentLoop: ChatResponse (text + tool_calls)
    AgentLoop->>Hooks: on_llm_output (Hermes extraction)
    AgentLoop-->>RustBridge: Response
    RustBridge-->>AgentSrv: {:ok, response}
    AgentSrv-->>BtwRouter: {:ok, response}
    BtwRouter-->>Gateway: Response
    Gateway->>Channel: send(SendMessage)
    Channel-->>User: Reply
    end

    rect rgb(245, 243, 255)
    Note over User, BtwServer: Flow 2 - Tool Execution
    AgentLoop->>Tool: execute(tool_name, params)
    Tool->>Memory: store/recall (if memory tool)
    Memory-->>Tool: Result
    Tool-->>AgentLoop: ToolResult
    AgentLoop->>Provider: LLM with tool result
    Provider-->>AgentLoop: Next response
    end

    rect rgb(248, 250, 252)
    Note over User, BtwServer: Flow 3 - Agent Delegation
    AgentSrv->>Coordinator: delegate(task, capabilities)
    Note over Coordinator: find_matching + ACL check
    Coordinator->>AgentSrv: run_task/3 (matched agent)
    AgentSrv->>RustBridge: run_task/3
    RustBridge->>AgentLoop: Execute delegated task
    AgentLoop-->>RustBridge: Result
    RustBridge-->>AgentSrv: {:ok, result}
    AgentSrv-->>Coordinator: {:ok, result}
    Coordinator-->>AgentSrv: Delegation result
    end

    rect rgb(253, 245, 247)
    Note over User, BtwServer: Flow 4 - BTW Side-Channel
    User->>Channel: /btw check logs
    Channel->>Gateway: ChannelMessage
    Gateway->>BtwRouter: route_message/3
    BtwRouter->>BtwServer: start_btw (via BtwSupervisor)
    BtwServer->>RustBridge: run_task/3
    RustBridge->>AgentLoop: Execute side task
    AgentLoop-->>RustBridge: Result
    RustBridge-->>BtwServer: {:ok, result}
    BtwServer->>RustBridge: send_to_channel(response)
    RustBridge-->>Channel: Reply (non-blocking)
    end
